@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### Liste lesen (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/parts
X-Correlation-ID: manual-list

### Einzelnen Datensatz lesen (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/parts/1

### Gültigen Datensatz anlegen (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/parts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: manual-create

{
  "partNumber": "P-9999",
  "name": "Testfilter",
  "category": "Filter",
  "shelfCode": "T-01",
  "stockQuantity": 5,
  "reorderLevel": 2,
  "listPrice": 14.9
}

### Ungültigen Datensatz ablehnen (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/parts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: manual-validation

{}

### Vorhandenen fachlichen Schlüssel ablehnen (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/parts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: manual-conflict

{
  "partNumber": "P-1001",
  "name": "Testfilter",
  "category": "Filter",
  "shelfCode": "T-01",
  "stockQuantity": 5,
  "reorderLevel": 2,
  "listPrice": 14.9
}

### Seed-Datensatz mit unverändertem Schlüssel ersetzen (200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/parts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partNumber": "P-1001",
  "name": "Testfilter aktualisiert",
  "category": "Filter",
  "shelfCode": "T-01",
  "stockQuantity": 5,
  "reorderLevel": 2,
  "listPrice": 14.9
}

### Unbekannten Datensatz idempotent löschen (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/parts/999999
